Z||000006||ToddAsh||03-09-2001||06:14 PM||||Hi, I've made almost $65. parting out my nice,running '84 SE. I bought it because I needed the RF fender,felt bad about taking apart an undamaged running car but like you said,I got no takers at $500.That was running,driving,complete.I'm just parting it out as a learning experience,definitely not for a profit.Good Luck. Todd||||reg||1
