Z||000009||FieroLisa||03-10-2001||08:42 PM||||be patient. if you want money now, part it, but you won't get much. I put my car up for sale in September for $2300...everyone told me to take the price down but in the beginning of January, I got $2300 cash for it. I didn't even advertise it, just stuck it on the side of the road. I didn't sell it to a "fiero person" either, just some guy who thought my car was cool and the price was reasonable.||||reg||1
